# Build & dev (agents)

Space Solution is a static Astro 7 site. Agents iterate on source — not production artifacts.

## On demand only (default: off)

Do not run these unless the **user explicitly asks** or you are preparing a deploy they requested:

- `npm run build` — minify, thumbnails, icons, full Astro build
- `npm run dev` — same pre-scripts, then Astro dev
- `npm run dev:fast` — Astro dev only (no minify, thumbnails, or icon generation)
- `npm run preview` — requires a full build first
- `npm install` / postinstall — only when `package.json` or lockfile deps changed
- Integrated terminal commands in general — on demand when the user asks

## When the user asks for preview or terminal work

- Run the requested command; stop background jobs when done
- Prefer reminding the user about `dev-server/start-restart-dev.bat` unless they asked you to start the dev server in terminal

## Minify only when needed

- Run `node scripts/minify-js.mjs` only when `src/client/*.js` changed **and** the user wants runtime browser testing via dev server
- Do not minify on every edit; source lives in `src/client/`

## Asset pipeline scripts (run only when relevant assets change)

- `node scripts/generate-reel-thumbnails.mjs` — reel/video thumbnail assets changed
- `node scripts/generate-header-menu-icons.mjs` — header menu icons changed

## Deploy

- Full `npm run build` is required before Cloudflare deploy (`dist/` + minified `public/js/`)
- CI/CD handles production builds on push; agents do not need to build for every change
